{"hw":"διατελέω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">διατελέω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">διατελ-έω</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">fut.</span> <span class=\"gk\">-τελέσω,</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Att.</span> </span> <span class=\"gk\">-τελῶ</span>: <span class=\"lex-gram\">pf.</span> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <span class=\"gk\">διατετέλεκα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Cyr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.5.4</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">IG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">22.223<em>A</em>5</span> </span>:—<b class=\"lex-tr\">bring quite to an end, accomplish,</b> <span class=\"gk\">ἐπεί περ ἠρξάμην, διατελέσαι βούλομαι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">HG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.3.4</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">δ. χάριν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Heracl.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">434</span> </span>; so of Time, <span class=\"gk\">διατετελεκὼς τὰ ἐν τοῖς ἐφήβοις δέκα ἔτη</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Cyr.</cite> </span> l. c. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> abs., </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">1</span> mostly c. <span class=\"lex-gram\">part.</span>, <b class=\"lex-tr\">continue being</b> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">doing</b> so and so, <span class=\"gk\">τὸ λοιπὸν τῆς ζόης δ. ἐόντα τυφλόν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.117</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">δ. ἐόντες ἐλεύθεροι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <spa